WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.780
Tables: restaurant tables and table combinations for bigger parties.

2
00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:10.850
Create the table type under units and set each table's capacity.

3
00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:17.420
Under "Table combos", use "New combo" to pick tables that seat a bigger party together.

4
00:00:17.973 --> 00:00:24.470
Set the "Opening hours (hourly / tables)" and the "Prep / cleaning buffer (minutes)".

5
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:31.050
Parties above the set size need team approval; keep that limit realistic in the settings.
